so far most of my energy has been exploring and brainstorming ways to use agents to play the game while trying to offload much of the scut so it doesnt clog context window.  not as much focus on the fully LLM Jesus-take-the-wheel, but more guided control.  been working on creating composable parts that the LLM would be able to choose and kick off as it works on higher level goals.  rather tghan one onmi-agent  who can do everything, more of a swarm of specialists.  i.e., a series of commands that perform the given task in infinite loop to keep working when nothing else is going on.
`
auto-craftsman
auto-explorer
auto-fighter
auto-miner
auto-pirate
auto-prophet
auto-recall  (not a loop, this takes the agent from whereever and sends them to base to dock.)
auto-salvager
auto-trader
`  

