Spun off from this was a separate MCP server agents could call focused on Crafting.  https://github.com/rsned/spacemolt-crafting-server which was to help offload some area of complexity from the agents to make it easy to see what they can build, and using a variety of forward and reverse indexes to let the trace what goes where and what needs what. 


